# typescript/.gitignore (vendored verbatim from espruino/BangleApps) uses
# the pattern `./node_modules`, which is not a valid gitignore anchor (a
# leading `./` is taken literally and never matches), so it fails to ignore
# typescript/node_modules. This repo-root .gitignore covers the gap without
# modifying that vendored file.
typescript/node_modules/
